Additional information:

This bundle includes paths to and from the new dragons area, and Kotar, and
two loops for the new dragons area (one for solo and one for parties) - the
parties one tackles the two large regen rooms.

It is recommended that when you reach the Lava Bridge on your way to Kotar
that you RUN, as it does MASSIVE damage.

If you are looking for hides, you are better off using the old dragons loop.
These loops have the potential for about 700k ph solo.



